 in a fun and exciting community based arts program for children. This work
 shop offers an introduction into the enriching world of art and creativity
  through Poetry\, Music\, Theatre and Visual Arts.\nFor children ages 6-9.
 \nSpace is limited\, registration is required. Attendees must be able to a
 ttend all five sessions of the workshop.\nInformation Collection Notice:\n
