DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T150000
UID:6a04c472f89ee1580052adce@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and engaging workshop with award-winning aut
 hor Melanie Florence. Learn techniques for brainstorming and transforming 
