 hobic compounds to stay dry\, uncovering the fascinating science behind ev
 eryday reactions in a hands-on adventure. Take-home: Silly Putty\nFor kids
  ages 6-12. Space is limited.\nGentle Reminder:\nDue to high demand\, we k
 indly ask you to arrive on time so everyone has a chance to participate. S
 pots may be offered to those waiting after\n5 minutes.\nThank you for your
