 lls through interactive activities in robotics\, coding\, and STEM challen
 ges. Explore STEM concepts through real-world challenges\, develop coding 
 skills using block-based and text-based programming\, and collaborate to s
 olve problems and think like engineers. No prior experience is needed—ju
 st curiosity and a love for discovery!\nThis program will run for four day
 s from July 27th to July 30th\, from 1pm - 3pm. Children must be available
  to attend all four days. Program is suitable for ages 6 to 8 years old.
