UID:6a3e95bb5f884f9a10d91b12@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Astronomy Coding Club\, offered in partnership with the\nD
 unlap Institute\n\, introduces kids to the basics of Python coding while e
 xploring fascinating astronomical concepts. Participants will use code to 
 model and better understand real space phenomena such as planetary motion 
 and the phases of the Moon.\n*No prior coding or astronomy experience requ
 ired.*\nFor ages 9-12!\nDROP-IN!
LOCATION:Rexdale
