 6p.m.)\nJune 17-Portugal vs. Congo (1p.m.)\nJune 17-England vs. Croatia (4
 p.m.)\nJune 18-Czechia vs. South Africa (12p.m.)\nJune 18-Switzerland vs. 
 Bosnia (3p.m.)\nJune 18-Canada vs. Qatar (6p.m.)\nJune 19-United States vs
 . Australia (3p.m.)\nJune 19- Scotland vs. Morocco (6p.m.)\nJune 20-Nether
 lands vs. Sweden (1p.m.)\nJune 21-Belgium vs. Iran (3p.m.)\nJune 22-Argent
 ina vs. Austria (1p.m.)\nJune 22-France vs. Iraq (5p.m.)\nJune 23-Portugal
  vs. Uzbekistan (1p.m.)\nJune 23-England vs. Ghana (4p.m.)\nJune 24-Switze
 rland vs. Canada / Bosnia vs. Qatar (3p.m.)\nJune 24-Scotland vs. Brazil
