UID:6a399a342ea730c17ab8bef3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of magic\, mystery\, and creativity! In this
  fun and imaginative workshop\, kids will paint their very own enchanted f
 orest using bright acrylic paints. They will explore dreamy trees\, glowin
 g paths\, whimsical animals\, and hidden fairy homes while learning simple
  painting techniques like blending\, layering\, and texture. Perfect for y
 oung artists of all skill levels 8-10 years old.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a399a342ea730c17ab8bef3
