UID:6a2c33597550c8bf9f5cdfb7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Our book selection for July is\nThe Wonderful Wizard of Oz\nby
  L. Frank Baum. Swept away from her home in Kansas by a tornado\, Dorothy 
 and her dog Toto find themselves stranded in the fantastical land of Oz. A
  true classic of children's literature\, and enchantingly different from t
 he equally classic film.\nCopies available at the library.\nThe Wonderful 
 Wizard of Oz
