BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wonder Workshop: Introduction to Design Thinking Building Challeng
 e
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260714T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260714T153000
UID:6a0de400c6a1dc3d00d4f0b3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be an inventor
 ? Have you ever thought about building something yourself? What is somethi
 ng you would like to build? Is there a problem you would like to fix? Use 
 your imagination and brainstorm creative solutions to develop a machine th
 at will fix a problem or make a task easier for you! Plus\, enter a prize 
 draw for a chance to win an awesome book.\nInformation Collection Notice:\
 nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public 
 Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d
 ). The information will only be used for event and program registration\, 
 delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your info
 rmation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-
