  Kim brings an underwater world to life in her diorama art. Learn about th
 is amazing art form and how you can start making your own diorama at home.
   Soyeon will share how she uses drawing\, colouring\, and cutting techniq
 ues to assemble layered scenes that show depth\, texture\, and imagination
 . Then provide some inspiration for anyone ready to create their own mini 
 ocean world!\nZoom URL to access the online program will be emailed to reg
 istrants within 24 hours before the program starts.\nThis online program i
 s suitable for children ages 6-12. Younger children may require assistance
  from caregivers. It is recommended that parents or caregivers are present
