 ion.\nDay      2: Womp3D\n– Learn 3D sculpting to create smooth\, organi
 c\, and gooey      digital art.\nDay      3: Autodesk Fusion\n– Think li
 ke an engineer and dive into advanced\,      high-tech design.\nDay      4
 : Game Design Intro\n– Put your skills to the test and learn how to     
  create a fun video games\nThe Details:\nWho:\nCreative kids ages\n8 to 12
 \nWhen:\nMonday through Thursday\,\n10:00 AM – 11:00 AM\nWhere:\n[Aginco
 urt Library/Learning Centre]\n⚠️\nImportant Note:\nThis is a sequentia
 l\, cumulative program. Because each day builds directly on the last\,\nre
 gistrants must attend all 4 sessions\nto participate.\nSpace is limited\, 
